```bash
javac -d /tmp/binary_search_refactor_tests binary_search.java BinarySearchDemo.java BinarySearchTest.java
java -cp /tmp/binary_search_refactor_tests BinarySearchTest
java -cp /tmp/binary_search_refactor_tests BinarySearch
```

